# Row A1 recut — constrained determinant, ghost subtraction, symbol chain

Status report for the round that answered the recut A1a/A1b questions.
Everything named below is Lean 4 / Mathlib, in `RequestProject/YangMills/`, builds
with `lake build`, contains no `sorry`, no `axiom` and no unsafe pragma, and
